WEBVTT

00:00:30.917 --> 00:00:32.809
But then the old man,

00:00:32.833 --> 00:00:35.143
King Priam of Troy,

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:38.184
says something strange and wonderful

00:00:38.208 --> 00:00:42.708
but difficult for our generation
to fully comprehend.

00:00:43.833 --> 00:00:48.059
"I don't care if the Greeks kill me,

00:00:48.083 --> 00:00:54.101
just as long as I first have
the heart-comforting embrace

00:00:54.125 --> 00:00:58.059
of my dead son in my arms."

00:00:58.083 --> 00:01:01.375
"My dead son in my arms?"